    "title": "What time is USA vs Dominican Republic baseball game? How to watch WBC semifinal",
    "text": "Updated March 15, 2026, 7:11 p.m. ETDeeperDiveBETADeeperDive is a GenAI Answer Engine built for trusted publishers. It delivers clear answers and real-time content based on what people are reading now — showcasing various stories from the usatodaydemo Network that highlight not just what happened, but why it matters. This is currently a BETA being quality assessed by human beings. Mistakes may occur. Please reference surfaced articles to validate AI summaryFollow USA vs. Dominican Republic live: Keep up with score and latest WBC highlightsTeam USA and the Dominican Republic square off in the World Baseball Classic quarterfinals on Sunday, with a spot on the tournament's championship game on the line.The Americans are 4-1 in this WBC, needing some help to get out of group play before edging Canada in the quarterfinal. The DR is undefeated at 5-0 and has been crushing opponents, including a 10-0 win against South Korea in Friday's quarterfinal.The two countries met three times in the first five editions of the WBC, with the Dominicans winning two of those games. Reigning NL Cy Young Paul Skenes takes the mound for Team USA while the Dominican Republic counters with Athletics right-hander Luis Severino.The winner will face Venezuela or Italy in Tuesday's title game.Here's what to knowWhere to watch USA vs Dominican: WBC game time, TV channelTime: 8 p.m. ETTV channel: Fox Sports 1Live stream: FoxSports.com // FuboWatch 2025 WBC live on FuboWBC bracket 2026QuarterfinalsDominican Republic 10, South Korea 0 (F/7) – Friday in MiamiUnited States 5, Canada 3 – Friday in MiamiItaly 8, Puerto Rico 6 – Saturday in HoustonVenezuela 8, Japan 5 – Saturday in MiamiSemifinalsDominican Republic vs. United States – Sunday in Miami (BUY TICKETS)Italy vs. Venezuela – Monday in Miami (BUY TICKETS)WBC championship gameSemifinal winners – Tuesday, March 17 in Miami (BUY TICKETS)Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
